subject: Add microG account manager delegate
author: bearinmindcat <bearincrypto@gmail.com>
date: Tue, 22 Jul 2026

Route account enumeration and token requests through ReVanced microG
instead of Google Play Services. Accounts are read from the
app.revanced.android.gms auth ContentProvider; tokens come from
GoogleAuthUtil, which is redirected to microG post-build.
